{"date":"2025-09-23","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_d9f499b8daf93f9e9c332eaa41337c08","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1758619800,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-09-20","chunk":0,"id":"m_3d6fc6be3454c44e7bf42247f37219f6"}}},{"id":"m_1953e156bb041cbd2b1c7a46543bb970","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1758619837,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1ba03a05656ee7d0154adbdd8d53aaa8","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1758619874,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5d970b740f8c69b37d5502cae13c24c7","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1758619911,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_32461182271cedb7ab6c564059d60e41","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1758619948,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_01864bb9fe9f936a681c4cf10825dc6c","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1758619985,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4c01a2e1e120fcb1018f3485cc315bf7","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1758620022,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_ddafb9936ac3011adf45162039a2454d","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1758620059,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_9bcab97c8d793b431d9c45a856410d38","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1758620096,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7b708594e2a94f8a3e5263e43312c090","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1758620133,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_bd4d8455a5556cbe422cddb9160ff6dd","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1758620170,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_2e177263fe4516cf64e719900b7681b1","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1758620207,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3f1c0350ade3aa5255d814c5effd0cc0","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1758620244,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_93504d92efd9a89668bd1537d4b603d3","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1758620281,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4f7bb8613fab86bdebcb19e1727f470a","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1758620318,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c2465f3646cb2edd8e7013e839e9f019","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1758620355,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_0324bb351f5e31d746473fcb181cd660","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1758620392,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c40b4858982ff298f4c1291adfaab511","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1758620429,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_95eba67012412bf3e7dbbdb5480331ac","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1758620466,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_16afee78778f7412888600d8daf48742","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1758620503,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_95ac6f1f8b54079a6e69884283a1bde9","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1758620540,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_33ba96bdd55cd6f09a027cfca8d2c8f3","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1758620577,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_210d0469ee839ec4f5eec49ab90ff9c8","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1758620614,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a49e7d88935e6c5df0059afd12e1fa5b","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1758620651,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
